# A Game Boy ROM menu screen as the PS app draws it (platform/ps/menu.zig),
# played on the PS link by the Verilator harness (make sim SYSTEM=gb
# SIM_PS=this file; side track A) and rendered by Platform.Sim.Overlay for
# the golden (test/golden/vga/menu-overlay.png). Format:
# Platform.Sim.Overlay.
bar 0 1 ROM menu - Game Boy
text 1 1 /gb/games
text 3 2 local/
bar 4 2 libbet.gb
text 5 2 Puzzle (Rev 1) (Rev 1).gb
text 6 2 a very long name for a cartridge file that does not fit.g~
text 26 39 v
text 28 1 Cartridge type not supported (MBC).
bar 29 1 U/D move  R/C open  L back
# overlay on, game paused
ctrl 3
